description:
Server defines manual opcode constants (`core_method::HELLO = 1`, etc.) that mirror the discriminants of `marshal::core::Methods`, `marshal::registry::Methods`, etc.

Options:
1. Add `pub const` opcode constants alongside the enums in pipewire/
2. Enhance the `#[derive(Marshallable)]` macro to generate public associated constants
3. Simply make the enum discriminants accessible

Option 1 is simplest. Add e.g.:
```rust
// pipewire/src/protocol/marshal/core.rs
pub mod opcodes {
    pub const HELLO: u8 = 1;
    pub const SYNC: u8 = 2;
    // ...
}
```

Then server replaces its `core_method`, `core_event`, `registry_method`, `registry_event` modules with imports.
